; PhaseOrdering regression guard for the bjarne screen_init pattern:
; a doubly-nested init loop should collapse to a single @llvm.memset.
;
; This broke in an earlier defer-unroll + extra-unroll-after-vectorize
; experiment: the post-LV full unroll eagerly unrolled the stride-24
; inner loop before LoopIdiomRecognizePass on the outer could fold the
; nested pattern into a memset, leaving ~840 explicit stores in the
; final IR.
;
; Source equivalent (MultiSource/Benchmarks/Prolangs-C++/shapes/bjarne.cpp):
